    title: "ruby, kotlin and go drop a file with no symbols before the edge pass, so a top-level-only script (RSpec file, Rakefile, .kts, Go var _ = init file) emits no calls or imports"  # c7a0
    status: violated  # c7a0
    priority: 2  # c7a0
